  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "On Friday evening I rode my bike to the liquor store, bought a bottle of whiskey and put it in my bike basket.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "Before riding off, I thought that if I fell off the bike, the bottle would break.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "So I decided to drink the whole bottle right away, before riding home.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "And you know, it was a damn good decision, because I fell off seven times on the way home.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "laugh": "big"
    }
  ],
